Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Second Episode\NThe Silver Ship\NSapphire's Treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Silverland...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Silver as in the metal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Silverland means the Land of Silver.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}True to its name,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}silver was once endlessly mined here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.40,0:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because of it, ugly conflicts arose.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The king used brute force, even starting a war to hoard all the silver.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The realm fell into chaos and the people suffered, until a hero rose up in outrage.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The hero took all the silver, built a silver ship, and sank it in a swamp.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That secret is recorded here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:02:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time passed,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the old legend was eventually forgotten.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing there reading for days on end... Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is there anything good in those?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who hit me on the head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.13,0:03:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so damn long, I genuinely mistook it for something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.33,0:03:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man! It's the master's report!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's take a quick break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A break won't hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"Beneath three half-moons, a silver marsh slumbers in peace."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"As ripples spread, the Silver Ship rises,"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"and the Silver Knight cries out to the moon:"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"O Moon, O Moon, aid me and grant me power!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be a clue showing the location of the Silver Ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary Silver Ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that silver ship nobody can find?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This text must point to where the Silver Ship is hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So where exactly is that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it at all, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes, use those clues to find that silver ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...And that's how it went.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Is the Silver Ship really that great of a treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If it falls into the wrong hands, we'll be in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little worried since Duralumin knows about this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A great idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's a really good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you and I will find the treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and share it with everyone in the kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.28,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If we share it, everyone in the country will be rich, and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin won't be able to use it for evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That really is a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.90,0:05:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure hunt time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Search for the Silver Ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:06:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, crescent moon, crescent moon... silver ship, silver ship... ah, crescent moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.87,0:06:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you figure something out, Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I want to get my hands on it no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it really is an amazing treasure, Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.07,0:06:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we want to get our hands on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get that amazing treasure, sell it off abroad, and hire an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,An insanely powerful army!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught one! I caught one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakana-san, have you seen a ship made of silver
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,at the bottom of this pond?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge silver ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know? Ah, thank you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go getting caught again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You let my dinner get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mizutori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a silver ship sunken in this water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.43,0:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Three half-moons... Three half-moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A silver ship, a silver spring...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Three half-moons...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! I mean moons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How could there be three of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you solved the riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Nylon! I told him to solve the riddle, what is he doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Great Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "All right"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you were playing around instead of solving the riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Duke Duralumin, you must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the riddle of the Silver Ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "almost", Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as for the half-moons...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.57,0:07:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The half-moons mean archery bows!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:08:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Three bows lined up—that means three half-moons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that target over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.90,0:08:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three half-moons must refer to Bow Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,deep in the Northern Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where the Silver Ship is sunken!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Three bows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is three half-moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for the Silver Swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.77,0:08:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was the grass moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this area used to be a swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There used to be water here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what on earth was I riding all this time...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Silver Ship is right down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This has to be part of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...the mast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Greenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:10:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the Silver Ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:39.00,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Tsukiyo, kotaete kure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:39.00,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Moon, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Watashi wa nannen nemutte ita no da?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,How many years have I slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.16,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Dare ga watashi o okoshita no da?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.16,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Who awakened me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:46.78,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Tsukiyo, oshiete kure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:46.78,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Moon, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.54,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Mata wazawai ga chikazuite iru no ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.54,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Is calamity approaching again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:53.12,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Naraba, ware ni chikara o ataeyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:53.12,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Then grant me power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old Fukuro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a very old story, but have you ever heard of a silver ship
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,sunk in a pond around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be discouraged, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye!\N- Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Three half-moons in a row!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Bow Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what the three half-moons meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:11:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bow Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much we search, there's no swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the text, the Silver Swamp should be around here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:36.54,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Omae wa dare da.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:36.54,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:38.31,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Nani shi ni kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:38.31,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Prince Sapphire of this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.85,0:12:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I came looking for the legendary swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:46.36,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Yahari omae ga watashi o okoshita no da na.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:46.36,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,So it was you who woke me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:47.86,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Yokubari no oji me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:47.86,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,You greedy prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:50.39,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Hakugin no numa ni wa ippo mo chikazukasenu zo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:50.39,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get a single step closer to the Silver Swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Silver Swamp really is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.69,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Onore yokubari ningen me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.69,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Curse you, greedy human!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:40.74,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Mun-ku Tsuki yo... tsuki yo... watashi o tasukero...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:40.74,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,O Moon, O Moon, O moon, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:44.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Watashi ni chikara o ataeyo ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:44.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Will you give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.42,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Tsuki yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.42,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,O Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vampire bats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to escape before this fire goes out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A door!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dawdle any longer and dawn will break!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry to Bow Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it really weigh 100 tons?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely. Judging by that mast, 100 tons is an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.03,0:15:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,, It's enough to break this crane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how huge it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the sails are made of silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With this much, we could share it with everyone in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:10.24,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Nani sawaru denai ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:10.24,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Do not touch that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice... It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:13.16,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Kono fune wa watasanu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:13.16,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,I will not hand over this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:16.32,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Omae ni wa ano yokubari no ou no oroka na chi ga nagarete iru!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:16.32,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,The foolish blood of that greedy king flows in your veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:22.74,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Watashi wa suuhyakunen kono fune o mamotte kita gin no sei da!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:22.74,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,I am the Silver Spirit, guardian of this ship for centuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The mountain of treasure is just ahead, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to share this with everyone in the kingdom... no, the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:43.80,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Damare!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:43.80,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.79,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Omae no sosen no oroka na ou mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.79,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Your foolish ancestor said the same thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:48.66,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,sonna koto o itte gin o hitorijime ni shiyou to shita no da!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:48.66,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,trying to keep all the silver for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:50.18,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Sono tame ni,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:50.18,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.20,0:16:52.44,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,heiwa datta Silverland wa midare,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.20,0:16:52.44,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,peaceful Silverland was thrown into turmoil—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:55.34,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,sensou ga okori, nansen no ie ga yakare,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:55.34,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,war broke out, burning thousands of homes and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:57.78,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,nansen no hito no inochi ga ubawareta ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:57.78,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,claiming thousands of lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:01.63,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Omae no kotoba nado ni damasare wa shinai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:01.63,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,I won't be fooled by your words!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not tricking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want silver, gold, or jewels!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to share it with the poor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.01,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Damare!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.01,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Silver Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want silver, gold, or jewels!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to give them to the poor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.76,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Watashi no karada wa gin ni yotte
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.76,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Only my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:58.09,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,heiwa o midasaremai to suru tamashii dake
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:58.09,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,which refuses to let silver disrupt the peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:17:59.94,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,ga yoroi ni noriutsutte iru no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:17:59.94,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,has possessed this armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.28,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Omae ga watashi o tasuketa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.28,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Did you save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:17.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Naze da?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:17.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.22,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Oji
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.22,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've awakened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:57.10,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Tanomi ga aru,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:57.10,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.30,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Are o miyo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.30,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:18:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:00.32,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,So da!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:00.32,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,So it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:02.33,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Kono gin no fune o onore no mono ni shiyo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:02.33,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Fools consumed by greed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:04.66,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,to yoku ni tsukareta orokamono ga yattekita no da
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:04.66,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,have come to claim this silver ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the crane!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the crane!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:22.80,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Watashi wa tsuki no hikari o abinai to hatarakenai no da
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:22.80,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,I can't move without bathing in moonlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.36,0:19:26.98,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Watashi no kawari ni kono yoroi o kite, gin no fune o mamotte kure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.36,0:19:26.98,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Wear this armor in my place and protect the silver ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:29.98,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Kono yoroi wa kitto, sonata o mamoru daro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:29.98,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,This armor will surely protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.99,0:19:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A fish... No, we hooked the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Raise the crane!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the crane!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise it faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.34,0:20:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the silver ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't dawdle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it up quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are the fools blinded by greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth... are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Silver Spirit, guardian of this swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let greedy fools have this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.64,0:20:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bows!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot that monster with your bows!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.73,0:20:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:20:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Spears are no match for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.75,0:21:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.09,0:21:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea a monster like that existed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide behind that furnace!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.60,0:21:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's fighting the soldiers...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.25,0:21:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,, I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Release the chocks on this cart!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll run it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.98,0:22:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The water is coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.66,0:22:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.25,0:22:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you climb up before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.95,0:22:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault we missed out on the treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.21,0:22:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.98,0:22:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.01,0:22:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:07.30,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Oji yo, omae no okage de gin no fune o mamoru koto ga dekita.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:07.30,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Prince, thanks to you, the Silver Ship was saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.69,0:23:09.10,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Kono fune o omae ni oguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.69,0:23:09.10,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,I give this ship to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:12.90,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Gin no fune wa omae no takara da.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:12.90,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,The Silver Ship is your treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:15.61,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Tadashi, omae ga oi o tsugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:15.61,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,However, I will keep it at the bottom of the marsh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:17.09,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,heiwa na kuni o tsukuru made
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:17.09,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,until you take the throne
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:19.24,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,watashi ga numa no soko de azakatte oko.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:19.24,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,and build a peaceful kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:21.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Sore made watashi wa zutto kono
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:21.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,Until then, I will watch over you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:24.94,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,hakugin no numa no naka kara mimamotte iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:24.94,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,from within this Silver Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.50,0:23:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please watch over me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.33,0:23:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire will build a peaceful kingdom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:36.43,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sore made watashi wa zutto kono
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:36.43,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until then, I will watch over you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:39.41,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,{\i1}numa-numa kara mimamotte iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:39.41,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,,{\i1}from deep within this marsh.
